# JalRakshak

**AI-Based Water Quality Anomaly Detection and Response Prioritisation**

JalRakshak is a water-intelligence web application designed to support
monitoring of waterbodies, review of water-quality observations,
identification of unusual readings, and prioritisation of follow-up
actions. It brings monitoring data and operational workflows together
through a web frontend, a Java Spring Boot backend, a MySQL database,
and a Python-based AI/analytics component.

> **Project status:** Development project. The source repository is
> available on GitHub. Local backend startup and the `/api/health`
> endpoint have been tested by the project developer. Cloud deployment
> is still in progress; no public production URL is claimed here.

