The repository contains frontend modules and backend controllers for the
following areas:

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Module                              Purpose
  ----------------------------------- -----------------------------------
  Dashboard                           Presents an overview of monitoring
                                      and operational information.

  Waterbody monitoring                Displays waterbodies represented in
                                      the database.

  Water analysis and insights         Supports review and visualisation
                                      of water-quality observations.

  Monitoring map                      Provides a map-oriented view of
                                      monitoring locations.

  Alerts                              Supports recording and reviewing
                                      water-quality alerts.

  Response management                 Organises actions associated with
                                      alerts and their statuses.

  Citizen reports                     Provides a workflow for submitting
                                      and reviewing public reports.

  Sensor-data verification            Supports review of sensor-data
                                      provenance and verification status.

  Reports                             Provides reporting and summary
                                      views.

  Settings and interface preferences  Includes frontend settings, theme,
                                      language and notification-related
                                      modules.

