## Architecture

``` text
Browser
   |
   v
Frontend (HTML, CSS, JavaScript)
   |
   | HTTP / REST API requests
   v
Spring Boot Backend
   |
   | Spring Data JPA / Hibernate
   v
MySQL Database

Python AI / analytics scripts
   |
   v
Model training and prediction workflows
```

The frontend communicates with the backend through HTTP API requests.
The backend handles application logic and database operations. The
Python scripts are maintained separately in `ai-model/`; their execution
and integration should be configured according to the scripts and
requirements in that folder.

